      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Laconia%2C_Indiana",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Laconia’s first Methodist church, founded in 1842, once hosted services led by a minister traveling seven miles from Mauckport.",
